                "class ABase:\n    child: B\n\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\n        self.child = B()\n\nclass A(ABase):\n{a_body}\nclass B:\n    owner: A\n\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\n        self.owner = A()\n"
